1
00:00:00,863 --> 00:00:02,863
(Leonard:)Why? Because I got an ugly,
itchy sweater,

2
00:00:03,032 --> 00:00:05,572
(Leonard:)and my brother got a car?
No, I was her favourite.

3
00:00:06,802 --> 00:00:08,142
Yeah, I seem to be
a few tickets short.

4
00:00:08,437 --> 00:00:09,777
(Sheldon:)Are there more in the box?

5
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:11,639
(Leonard:)I think I got them all.

6
00:00:11,807 --> 00:00:13,587
(Leonard:)Nope, they're not in there.

7
00:00:13,742 --> 00:00:15,652
(Sheldon:)Well, you barely looked. Let me see.

8
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:19,491
No, no, no, I looked, and...
No more tickets.

9
00:00:19,648 --> 00:00:21,928
(Sheldon:)-Leonard, let me look in the box.
-Okay, Okay!

10
00:00:22,818 --> 00:00:26,928
(Leonard:)I'm gonna show you what's in the box.
but just... promise not to flip out?

11
00:00:27,089 --> 00:00:30,769
Why would I flip out? ls it a spider?

12
00:00:30,926 --> 00:00:32,166
It's a spider!

13
00:00:33,562 --> 00:00:37,512
(Penny:)No, if it was a spider,
Lenny would've flipped out.

14
00:00:37,666 --> 00:00:41,616
(Leonard:)Okay, Sheldon, I know I was supposed
to return this DVD a long time ago,

15
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,680
(Leonard:)and I know we
rented it on your card.

16
00:00:43,839 --> 00:00:45,839
But ifs been, like, seven years,

17
00:00:46,008 --> 00:00:47,488
(Leonard:)and clearly nothing bad has happened.

18
00:00:47,643 --> 00:00:51,923
So instead of being a giant
pain in the ass, like you always are,

19
00:00:52,081 --> 00:00:56,191
what if this onetime
you just tried staying calm?

20
00:01:02,124 --> 00:01:03,694
(Sheldon:)That seems like a reasonable request.

21
00:01:05,661 --> 00:01:08,541
Although so did, "Hoy, Leonard,
would you mind returning that DVD?"

22
00:01:10,532 --> 00:01:12,482
I'm sorry. I'll take care of it.

23
00:01:13,502 --> 00:01:14,882
(Leonard:)Okay.

24
00:01:15,804 --> 00:01:16,844
(Leonard:)I mean it. I'm going to.

25
00:01:18,874 --> 00:01:20,654
(Sheldon:)I believe you.

26
00:01:22,311 --> 00:01:23,981
(Leonard:)And you're going to stay calm?

27
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:26,180
(Sheldon:)I said I would.

28
00:01:31,387 --> 00:01:32,387
(Leonard:)How about that?

29
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:36,670
(Leonard:)Sheldon's being reasonable.

30
00:01:36,825 --> 00:01:41,035
(Penny:)Yeah, it's freaking me out.
I'm gonna go.

